#: Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:653
msgid "%1$d passed, %2$d warnings, %3$d failed"
msgstr "%1$d réussis, %2$d à surveiller, %3$d en échec"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:614
msgid "-all — hard fail, only the listed servers may send"
msgstr "-all — échec strict, seuls les serveurs listés peuvent envoyer"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:506
msgid "180 days is the usual target (15552000). A first deployment can use 3600 for an hour, or 86400 for a day."
msgstr "180 jours est la cible habituelle (15552000). Un premier déploiement peut utiliser 3600 pendant une heure, ou 86400 pendant un jour."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:484
msgid "301 is what search engines expect for a definitive move to HTTPS."
msgstr "301 est ce que les moteurs de recherche attendent pour un passage définitif en HTTPS."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:615
msgid "?all — neutral, no position taken"
msgstr "?all — neutre, aucune position prise"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:501
msgid "A browser that has seen the header refuses plain HTTP for the whole max-age, even if you remove the header afterwards. Start with a short max-age, confirm the site is stable for a week, then raise it."
msgstr "Un navigateur qui a vu l’en-tête refuse le HTTP en clair pendant toute la durée du max-age, même si vous retirez l’en-tête ensuite. Commencez par un max-age court, vérifiez que le site tient une semaine, puis augmentez."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:417
msgid "A hardening plugin that acts the moment it is activated is a liability. Audit mode is the default, and the audit screen shows exactly what apply would change."
msgstr "Un plugin de durcissement qui agit dès son activation est un risque. Le mode audit est celui par défaut, et l’écran d’audit montre exactement ce que « appliquer » changerait."

#: Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:298
msgid "A max-age below 180 days is a transitional value."
msgstr "Un max-age inférieur à 180 jours est une valeur de transition."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:595
msgid "A plugin cannot write DNS"
msgstr "Un plugin ne peut pas écrire dans le DNS"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:354
msgid "Active"
msgstr "Actif"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:755
msgid "Activity"
msgstr "Activité"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:244
msgid "Activity log cleared."
msgstr "Journal d’activité vidé."

#: Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:308
msgid "Add define( 'FORCE_SSL_ADMIN', true ); to wp-config.php — the login cookie is worth as much as the password."
msgstr "Ajoutez define( 'FORCE_SSL_ADMIN', true ); dans wp-config.php — le cookie de connexion vaut autant que le mot de passe."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:459
msgid "Add this line to wp-config.php to stop every change without touching the database:"
msgstr "Ajoutez cette ligne dans wp-config.php pour arrêter tout changement sans toucher à la base :"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:508
msgid "Add “preload”"
msgstr "Ajouter « preload »"

#: Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:303
msgid "Admin forced over HTTPS"
msgstr "Administration forcée en HTTPS"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:548
msgid "An https URL that receives the violation reports. Leave empty to keep the reports in the browser console only."
msgstr "Une URL https qui reçoit les rapports de violation. Laissez vide pour garder les rapports dans la console du navigateur seulement."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:588
msgid "Announces the PHP version. Best removed in php.ini (expose_php = Off); this covers the rest."
msgstr "Annonce la version de PHP. Le mieux est de la retirer dans php.ini (expose_php = Off) ; ceci couvre le reste."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:587
msgid "Announces the XML-RPC endpoint on every response."
msgstr "Annonce le point d’accès XML-RPC à chaque réponse."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:589
msgid "Answer 404 for readme.html"
msgstr "Répondre 404 pour readme.html"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:554 Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:337
msgid "Anti-clickjacking"
msgstr "Anti-détournement de clic"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:415
msgid "Apply — the switches below take effect"
msgstr "Appliquer — les interrupteurs ci-dessous prennent effet"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:392
msgid "Applying"
msgstr "Applique"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:452
msgid "Asks github.com for the latest release once every 12 hours, and shows it on the Plugins and Updates screens. It is the only outbound request the plugin makes: switch it off to keep the plugin fully offline and update by hand."
msgstr "Interroge github.com une fois toutes les 12 heures pour connaître la dernière version, et l’affiche dans les écrans Extensions et Mises à jour. C’est la seule requête sortante du plugin : désactivez-la pour le garder entièrement hors ligne et mettre à jour à la main."

#: Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:487
msgid "Asset versions hidden"
msgstr "Versions des ressources masquées"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:380
msgid "Audit"
msgstr "Audit"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:252
msgid "Audit complete: the report below was measured on the live site just now."
msgstr "Audit terminé : le rapport ci-dessous vient d’être mesuré sur le site en ligne."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:392
msgid "Audit only"
msgstr "Audit seul"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:414
msgid "Audit only — measure, change nothing"
msgstr "Audit seul — mesurer, ne rien changer"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:73 Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:74
msgid "Bastion"
msgstr "Bastion"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:288
msgid "Bastion %1$s — a plugin by %2$s, dev by %3$s."
msgstr "Bastion %1$s — un plugin de %2$s, développement par %3$s."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:262
msgid "Bastion is in audit mode."
msgstr "Bastion est en mode audit."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:375
msgid "Bastion sections"
msgstr "Sections de Bastion"

#: Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:490
msgid "Bastion → Disclosures → asset versions."
msgstr "Bastion → Divulgations → versions des ressources."

#: Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:480
msgid "Bastion → Disclosures → generator."
msgstr "Bastion → Divulgations → générateur."

#: Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:470
msgid "Bastion → Disclosures, or expose_php = Off in php.ini."
msgstr "Bastion → Divulgations, ou expose_php = Off dans php.ini."

#: Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:298
msgid "Bastion → HTTPS → HSTS, once HTTPS is confirmed working."
msgstr "Bastion → HTTPS → HSTS, une fois le HTTPS confirmé."

#: Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:287
msgid "Bastion → HTTPS → force, or a server-level redirect."
msgstr "Bastion → HTTPS → forcer, ou une redirection au niveau du serveur."

#: Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:332
msgid "Bastion → Headers → policy."
msgstr "Bastion → En-têtes → politique."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:487
msgid "Behind a proxy"
msgstr "Derrière un proxy"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:783
msgid "Changes apply immediately."
msgstr "Les changements s’appliquent immédiatement."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:729 Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:668
msgid "Check"
msgstr "Contrôle"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:452
msgid "Check GitHub for updates"
msgstr "Rechercher les mises à jour sur GitHub"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:647
msgid "Choose a mail provider, or type a custom source, to generate the record."
msgstr "Choisissez un fournisseur de messagerie, ou saisissez une source personnalisée, pour générer l’enregistrement."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:331
msgid "Choose…"
msgstr "Choisir…"

#: Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:282
msgid "Clear text redirects to HTTPS"
msgstr "Le trafic en clair redirige vers HTTPS"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:790
msgid "Clear the log"
msgstr "Vider le journal"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:516 Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:328
msgid "Content-Security-Policy"
msgstr "Content-Security-Policy"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:579
msgid "Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy"
msgstr "Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:537
msgid "Custom"
msgstr "Personnalisée"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:606
msgid "Custom SPF source"
msgstr "Source SPF personnalisée"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:543
msgid "Custom policy"
msgstr "Politique personnalisée"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:677 Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:441
msgid "DKIM"
msgstr "DKIM"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:678
msgid "DKIM is provider-specific: enable it in the mail provider’s console, publish the TXT record it gives you, and keep the private key where it is. No plugin can generate it for you."
msgstr "DKIM dépend du fournisseur : activez-le dans la console du fournisseur, publiez l’enregistrement TXT qu’il vous donne, et laissez la clé privée là où elle est. Aucun plugin ne peut le générer à votre place."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:620
msgid "DMARC"
msgstr "DMARC"

#: Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:424 Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:426 Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:432
msgid "DMARC published"
msgstr "DMARC publié"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:667
msgid "DMARC — TXT record at _dmarc.%s"
msgstr "DMARC — enregistrement TXT sur _dmarc.%s"

#: Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:650
msgid "Date"
msgstr "Date"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:454
msgid "Delete all plugin data when the plugin is deleted"
msgstr "Supprimer toutes les données du plugin lors de sa suppression"

#: Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:519
msgid "Delete readme.html, or let Bastion answer 404 for it."
msgstr "Supprimez readme.html, ou laissez Bastion répondre 404 à sa place."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:604
msgid "Determines the SPF include. Pre-selected when the MX record matches a known provider."
msgstr "Détermine l’include SPF. Présélectionné quand l’enregistrement MX correspond à un fournisseur connu."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:578
msgid "Disables a browser feature for the whole site. Empty to send nothing."
msgstr "Désactive une fonctionnalité du navigateur pour tout le site. Vide pour n’envoyer aucun en-tête."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:581 Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:698 Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:663
msgid "Disclosures"
msgstr "Divulgations"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:121 Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:798
msgid "Documentation"
msgstr "Documentation"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:600 Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:602 Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:389
msgid "Domain"
msgstr "Domaine"

#: Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:397
msgid "Domain checked"
msgstr "Domaine vérifié"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:721
msgid "Download the report"
msgstr "Télécharger le rapport"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:472
msgid "Dry run: log instead of redirect"
msgstr "Mode à blanc : journaliser au lieu de rediriger"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:379 Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:697 Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:662
msgid "Email"
msgstr "Messagerie"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:458
msgid "Emergency disable"
msgstr "Désactivation d’urgence"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:405
msgid "Enable Bastion"
msgstr "Activer Bastion"

#: Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:444
msgid "Enable DKIM in your mail provider, then keep the key it gives you."
msgstr "Activez DKIM chez votre fournisseur, puis conservez la clé qu’il vous donne."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:610
msgid "End of the SPF record"
msgstr "Fin de l’enregistrement SPF"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:525
msgid "Enforce"
msgstr "Appliquer (bloquant)"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:507
msgid "Every subdomain must then serve HTTPS — including the ones you have forgotten."
msgstr "Chaque sous-domaine doit alors servir du HTTPS — y compris ceux que vous avez oubliés."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:731 Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:668
msgid "Evidence"
msgstr "Preuve"

#: Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:348
msgid "File types locked (nosniff)"
msgstr "Types de fichiers verrouillés (nosniff)"

#: Bastion/includes/class-updater.php:154
msgid "Forces HTTPS, sets the security headers, closes the version leaks and audits the result on the live site — with nothing applied until you ask."
msgstr "Force le HTTPS, pose les en-têtes de sécurité, ferme les fuites de version et audite le résultat sur le site en ligne — rien n’est appliqué tant que vous ne le demandez pas."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:550
msgid "Framing and the rest"
msgstr "Encadrement et le reste"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:514
msgid "Framing, MIME sniffing, referrer, permissions and the policy below."
msgstr "Encadrement, reniflage MIME, referrer, permissions et la politique ci-dessous."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:497
msgid "HSTS"
msgstr "HSTS"

#: Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:295
msgid "HSTS is set"
msgstr "HSTS est posé"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:377 Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:695 Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:660
msgid "HTTPS"
msgstr "HTTPS"

#: Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:264
msgid "HTTPS answers"
msgstr "Le HTTPS répond"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:358
msgid "HTTPS, security headers, a domain that cannot be spoofed, and a report that proves it — measured on the live site, and reversible at every step."
msgstr "HTTPS, en-têtes de sécurité, un domaine qui ne peut pas être usurpé, et un rapport qui le prouve — mesuré sur le site en ligne, et réversible à chaque étape."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:378 Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:696 Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:661
msgid "Headers"
msgstr "En-têtes"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:449 Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:776
msgid "Housekeeping"
msgstr "Entretien"

#: Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:269
msgid "If the site has no certificate yet, this check cannot pass. Nothing is changed by the plugin until it does."
msgstr "Si le site n’a pas encore de certificat, ce contrôle ne peut pas réussir. Le plugin ne change rien tant que c’est le cas."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:507
msgid "Include subdomains"
msgstr "Inclure les sous-domaines"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:579
msgid "Isolates the page from the windows it opens. Off by default: it breaks pop-up based sign-in (OAuth, some payment providers)."
msgstr "Isole la page des fenêtres qu’elle ouvre. Désactivé par défaut : cela casse les connexions par fenêtre surgissante (OAuth, certains prestataires de paiement)."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:263
msgid "It measures and reports; nothing on the front end has been changed. Read the report, then switch to “Apply” when the failures make sense to you."
msgstr "Il mesure et rapporte ; rien n’a été changé sur le front. Lisez le rapport, puis passez à « Appliquer » quand les échecs vous paraissent cohérents."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:423
msgid "It never edits wp-config.php, .htaccess or the theme. It never touches the database schema. It writes no file. Everything it does is a response header, a redirect, or a filter — and deactivating restores the previous behaviour instantly."
msgstr "Il ne modifie jamais wp-config.php, .htaccess ni le thème. Il ne touche pas au schéma de la base. Il n’écrit aucun fichier. Tout ce qu’il fait est un en-tête de réponse, une redirection ou un filtre — et la désactivation rétablit le comportement précédent instantanément."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:453
msgid "Keep a small activity log"
msgstr "Tenir un petit journal d’activité"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:472
msgid "Keep this on for a day: the log shows what would have been redirected, and nothing breaks if the certificate is not ready."
msgstr "Laissez-le activé une journée : le journal montre ce qui aurait été redirigé, et rien ne casse si le certificat n’est pas prêt."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:426
msgid "Last measurement"
msgstr "Dernière mesure"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:602
msgid "Leave empty to use the site host."
msgstr "Laissez vide pour utiliser l’hôte du site."

#: Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:361
msgid "Limits what the browser tells other sites about your URLs."
msgstr "Limite ce que le navigateur dit aux autres sites au sujet de vos URL."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:604
msgid "Mail provider"
msgstr "Fournisseur de messagerie"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:750
msgid "Markdown — copy it into an e-mail, a ticket or a client report"
msgstr "Markdown — à copier dans un e-mail, un ticket ou un rapport client"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:506
msgid "Max-age (seconds)"
msgstr "Max-age (secondes)"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:407 Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:520
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Mode"

#: Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:417
msgid "More than 10 DNS lookups: the record may be ignored by receivers."
msgstr "Plus de 10 requêtes DNS : l’enregistrement peut être ignoré par les destinataires."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:654
msgid "Name: @ — Type: TXT — Value above. One SPF record per domain, never two."
msgstr "Nom : @ — Type : TXT — Valeur ci-dessus. Un seul enregistrement SPF par domaine, jamais deux."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:442
msgid "No audit has run yet. It is a read-only measurement: run it now, nothing will be changed."
msgstr "Aucun audit n’a encore tourné. C’est une mesure en lecture seule : lancez-la, rien ne sera changé."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:684
msgid "No measurement yet"
msgstr "Aucune mesure pour l’instant"

#: Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:498
msgid "No mixed content"
msgstr "Aucun contenu mixte"

#: Bastion/includes/class-disclosure.php:239
msgid "Not found."
msgstr "Introuvable."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:398
msgid "Nothing is being changed: Bastion measures the site and reports. Switch to “Apply” when you are ready."
msgstr "Rien n’est modifié : Bastion mesure le site et rapporte. Passez à « Appliquer » quand vous êtes prêt."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:760
msgid "Nothing logged yet. Bastion records what it did — a redirect it made, a file it blocked, a setting you saved."
msgstr "Rien dans le journal. Bastion note ce qu’il a fait — une redirection, un fichier bloqué, un réglage enregistré."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:354 Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:523 Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:559
msgid "Off"
msgstr "Non"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:471
msgid "Off by default. Only GET and HEAD are redirected: redirecting a POST silently turns it into a GET and loses the form."
msgstr "Désactivé par défaut. Seuls GET et HEAD sont redirigés : rediriger un POST le transforme silencieusement en GET et perd le formulaire."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:405
msgid "Off removes every header, every redirect and every change, without touching a single option."
msgstr "Désactivé, cela retire chaque en-tête, chaque redirection et chaque changement, sans toucher à une seule option."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:494
msgid "One address or CIDR range per line. The forwarded scheme is only read when the direct peer is on this list — otherwise any visitor could claim to be on HTTPS."
msgstr "Une adresse ou une plage CIDR par ligne. Le schéma transmis n’est lu que si le pair direct figure dans cette liste — sinon n’importe quel visiteur pourrait prétendre être en HTTPS."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:508
msgid "Only meaningful once the domain is submitted to the browser preload list. It requires “include subdomains”."
msgstr "N’a de sens qu’une fois le domaine soumis à la liste de préchargement des navigateurs. Cela exige « inclure les sous-domaines »."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:505
msgid "Only sent over HTTPS. Off by default, and it cannot be undone quickly once browsers have seen it."
msgstr "Envoyé uniquement en HTTPS. Désactivé par défaut, et il ne peut pas être annulé rapidement une fois que les navigateurs l’ont vu."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:489
msgid "Only when a CDN or a load balancer terminates TLS in front of the site. Without it, redirecting every request would loop for ever."
msgstr "Uniquement quand un CDN ou un répartiteur de charge termine le TLS devant le site. Sans cela, rediriger chaque requête boucherait indéfiniment."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:266
msgid "Open the report"
msgstr "Ouvrir le rapport"

#: Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:370
msgid "Optional: disables camera, microphone and geolocation for the whole site."
msgstr "Optionnel : désactive la caméra, le micro et la géolocalisation pour tout le site."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:454
msgid "Options, log and transients are removed. The plugin does nothing until you delete it."
msgstr "Options, journal et transients sont supprimés. Le plugin ne fait rien avant que vous ne le supprimiez."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:461
msgid "Or use WP-CLI:"
msgstr "Ou avec WP-CLI :"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:606
msgid "Overrides the provider, for a relay that is not listed."
msgstr "Remplace le fournisseur, pour un relais qui n’est pas dans la liste."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:376
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Vue d’ensemble"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:635
msgid "Percentage"
msgstr "Pourcentage"

#: Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:366
msgid "Permissions policy"
msgstr "Politique de permissions"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:578
msgid "Permissions-Policy"
msgstr "Permissions-Policy"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:532 Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:624
msgid "Policy"
msgstr "Politique"

#: Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:408 Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:426
msgid "Publish the record below at your registrar."
msgstr "Publiez l’enregistrement ci-dessous chez votre registrar."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:500
msgid "Read this before switching HSTS on"
msgstr "À lire avant d’activer HSTS"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:634
msgid "Receives the aggregate reports. A dedicated address is cleaner than a mailbox you read."
msgstr "Reçoit les rapports agrégés. Une adresse dédiée est plus propre qu’une boîte que vous lisez."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:469
msgid "Redirect"
msgstr "Redirection"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:566 Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:357
msgid "Referrer policy"
msgstr "Politique de referrer"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:585
msgid "Remove RSD and WLW manifest links"
msgstr "Retirer les liens RSD et WLW manifest"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:587
msgid "Remove X-Pingback"
msgstr "Retirer X-Pingback"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:588
msgid "Remove X-Powered-By"
msgstr "Retirer X-Powered-By"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:586
msgid "Remove shortlink"
msgstr "Retirer le shortlink"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:584
msgid "Remove the ?ver= version"
msgstr "Retirer la version du ?ver="

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:583
msgid "Remove the generator meta"
msgstr "Retirer la balise generator"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:586
msgid "Removes the shortlink tag and header."
msgstr "Retire la balise et l’en-tête shortlink."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:634
msgid "Report address"
msgstr "Adresse de rapport"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:548
msgid "Report endpoint (optional)"
msgstr "Point d’envoi des rapports (optionnel)"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:524
msgid "Report only — nothing is blocked"
msgstr "Rapport seul — rien n’est bloqué"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:527
msgid "Report-only makes the browser report what it would have blocked, without blocking it: it is the only honest way to build a policy on a site you did not write."
msgstr "Le mode rapport demande au navigateur de signaler ce qu’il aurait bloqué, sans le bloquer : c’est la seule façon honnête de construire une politique sur un site que vous n’avez pas écrit."

#: Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:651
msgid "Result"
msgstr "Résultat"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:689
msgid "Run the audit"
msgstr "Lancer l’audit"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:720
msgid "Run the audit again"
msgstr "Relancer l’audit"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:446
msgid "Run the audit now"
msgstr "Lancer l’audit maintenant"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:596
msgid "SPF and DMARC are TXT records published at your registrar. Bastion writes the exact records for your domain, and reads back what is actually published — but you (or your host) have to paste them."
msgstr "SPF et DMARC sont des enregistrements TXT publiés chez votre registrar. Bastion écrit les enregistrements exacts pour votre domaine, et relit ce qui est réellement publié — mais c’est à vous (ou à votre hébergeur) de les coller."

#: Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:406 Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:408 Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:414
msgid "SPF published"
msgstr "SPF publié"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:645
msgid "SPF — TXT record at the domain"
msgstr "SPF — enregistrement TXT sur le domaine"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:535
msgid "Safe — framing, base URI, plugins, forms"
msgstr "Sûre — encadrement, base URI, plugins, formulaires"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:782
msgid "Save changes"
msgstr "Enregistrer les modifications"

#: Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:503
msgid "Search the theme and the plugins for http:// URLs, or the database if they come from the content."
msgstr "Cherchez des URL http:// dans le thème et les plugins, ou dans la base si elles viennent du contenu."

#: Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:648
msgid "Security audit"
msgstr "Audit de sécurité"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:505
msgid "Send Strict-Transport-Security"
msgstr "Envoyer Strict-Transport-Security"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:471
msgid "Send clear-text requests to HTTPS"
msgstr "Envoyer les requêtes en clair vers HTTPS"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:514
msgid "Send security headers"
msgstr "Envoyer les en-têtes de sécurité"

#: Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:467
msgid "Server version hidden"
msgstr "Version du serveur masquée"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:102
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Réglages"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:245
msgid "Settings saved."
msgstr "Réglages enregistrés."

#: Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:389
msgid "Settings → Email."
msgstr "Réglages → Messagerie."

#: Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:257
msgid "Settings → General: put https:// in both fields."
msgstr "Réglages → Général : mettez https:// dans les deux champs."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:635
msgid "Share of the messages the policy applies to. Raise it once the reports are clean."
msgstr "Part des messages auxquels la politique s’applique. Augmentez-la quand les rapports sont propres."

#: Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:649
msgid "Site"
msgstr "Site"

#: Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:254
msgid "Site address uses HTTPS"
msgstr "L’adresse du site utilise HTTPS"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:673
msgid "Start with p=none, read the reports for a fortnight, then move to quarantine and finally reject."
msgstr "Commencez par p=none, lisez les rapports quinze jours, puis passez à quarantine et enfin à reject."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:617
msgid "Start with ~all, read a week of reports, then move to -all."
msgstr "Commencez par ~all, lisez une semaine de rapports, puis passez à -all."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:730 Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:668
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Statut"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:476
msgid "Status code"
msgstr "Code de statut"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:575
msgid "Stops a URL that contains a token from leaking to an external site through the Referer header."
msgstr "Empêche une URL contenant un jeton de fuiter vers un site externe via l’en-tête Referer."

#: Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:352
msgid "Stops a browser from running an uploaded file as a script."
msgstr "Empêche un navigateur d’exécuter un fichier téléversé comme un script."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:583
msgid "Stops the page from announcing the WordPress version."
msgstr "Empêche la page d’annoncer la version de WordPress."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:536
msgid "Strict — everything from the same origin"
msgstr "Stricte — tout depuis la même origine"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:561
msgid "The CSP frame-ancestors directive is kept consistent with this choice, so the two can never contradict each other."
msgstr "La directive CSP frame-ancestors reste cohérente avec ce choix, pour que les deux ne puissent jamais se contredire."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:686
msgid "The audit fetches the site’s own pages and reads the real response headers, then queries DNS. It changes nothing. Run it to get the evidence."
msgstr "L’audit récupère les pages du site et lit les en-têtes réellement renvoyés, puis interroge le DNS. Il ne change rien. Lancez-le pour obtenir les preuves."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:439
msgid "The full evidence is on the Audit tab."
msgstr "Les preuves complètes sont dans l’onglet Audit."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:453
msgid "The last 30 events, with no visitor address."
msgstr "Les 30 derniers événements, sans adresse de visiteur."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:777
msgid "The log keeps the last 30 events, with no visitor address and no personal data."
msgstr "Le journal garde les 30 derniers événements, sans adresse de visiteur ni donnée personnelle."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:638
msgid "The records to publish"
msgstr "Les enregistrements à publier"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:748
msgid "The same report, as text"
msgstr "Le même rapport, en texte"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:397
msgid "The switches below are live on the front end."
msgstr "Les interrupteurs ci-dessous sont actifs sur le front."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:584
msgid "The version is replaced by a hash of the file, so caches still refresh when a file changes."
msgstr "La version est remplacée par une empreinte du fichier : les caches se rafraîchissent toujours quand un fichier change."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:489
msgid "Trust reverse-proxy headers"
msgstr "Faire confiance aux en-têtes du proxy inverse"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:492
msgid "Trusted proxy addresses"
msgstr "Adresses des proxies de confiance"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:585
msgid "Two legacy discovery links that no current client uses."
msgstr "Deux liens de découverte hérités qu’aucun client actuel n’utilise."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:545
msgid "Used when “Custom” is chosen above. One line; report-uri is appended automatically if you set one below."
msgstr "Utilisée quand « Personnalisée » est choisi ci-dessus. Une seule ligne ; report-uri est ajouté automatiquement si vous en définissez un plus bas."

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:411
msgid "What Bastion may do"
msgstr "Ce que Bastion a le droit de faire"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:422
msgid "What this plugin never does"
msgstr "Ce que ce plugin ne fait jamais"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:732
msgid "What to do"
msgstr "Que faire"

#: Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:341
msgid "Without it, the site can be framed and overlaid with a fake form."
msgstr "Sans cela, le site peut être encadré et recouvert d’un faux formulaire."

#: Bastion/includes/class-audit.php:477
msgid "WordPress version hidden"
msgstr "Version de WordPress masquée"

#: Bastion/includes/class-admin.php:589
msgid "Works when the request reaches WordPress. A web server that serves the file directly must have it deleted or blocked in its configuration — the audit reports what actually happens. Only readme.html, license.txt and wp-config-sample.php at the root are touched."
msgstr "Fonctionne quand la requête atteint WordPress. Un serveur web qui sert le fichier directement doit le voir supprimé ou bloqué dans sa configuration — l’audit rapporte ce qui se passe réellement. Seuls readme.html, license.txt et wp-config-sample.php à la racine sont touchés."

